---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-stepper</code> shows where the person is in a multi-step flow, such as checkout or
  onboarding. It only shows progress: the app renders each step's content itself and moves the
  stepper by setting <code>current</code> to a step's <code>value</code>. Steps before the current
  one show a check, later ones their number.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style='width: 100%;'>
    <wc-stepper current='shipping' label='Checkout'>
      <wc-step value='cart' label='Cart'></wc-step>
      <wc-step value='shipping' label='Shipping'></wc-step>
      <wc-step value='payment' label='Payment'></wc-step>
      <wc-step value='review' label='Review'></wc-step>
    </wc-stepper>
  </div>
</DemoComponentCard>

<p>
  A step without a <code>value</code> is named by its zero-based index, so
  <code>current="1"</code> is the second step. An empty or unknown <code>current</code> means the
  first step.
</p>

<h3>Wizard</h3>
<p>
  <code>next()</code> and <code>previous()</code> move to the next or previous step that is not
  disabled. They do not fire <code>change</code>, which is only for the person's own choice.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style='width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;'>
    <wc-stepper id='stepper-wizard' current='account' label='Sign up'>
      <wc-step value='account' label='Account'></wc-step>
      <wc-step value='team' label='Team' optional></wc-step>
      <wc-step value='billing' label='Billing'></wc-step>
      <wc-step value='done' label='Done'></wc-step>
    </wc-stepper>
    <p id='stepper-wizard-content' style='margin: 0;'>Step content: account</p>
    <div style='display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: flex-end;'>
      <wc-button id='stepper-wizard-back' variant='outlined'>Back</wc-button>
      <wc-button id='stepper-wizard-next'>Next</wc-button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var stepper = document.querySelector('#stepper-wizard');
      var content = document.querySelector('#stepper-wizard-content');
      function show() {
        content.textContent = 'Step content: ' + stepper.current;
      }
      document.querySelector('#stepper-wizard-back').addEventListener('click', function () {
        stepper.previous();
        show();
      });
      document.querySelector('#stepper-wizard-next').addEventListener('click', function () {
        stepper.next();
        show();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>
